==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|specimen||mark, sign, example|lang=la}}, from {{term|specio|speciō|observe, watch|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|Canada|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈspesɪmɪn/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|pl2=specimina}}

# An [[individual]] [[instance]] that [[represent]]s a [[class]]; an [[example]].
# A [[sample]], especially one used for [[diagnostic]] [[analysis]].
# {{humorous|often preceded with “fine”}} An [[eligible]] man.
#: Examples: ''[[:File:PostcardLeapYearBeCarefulClara1908.jpg|Postcard: Leap Year, 1908]]'', ''[[:File:Trinity College, Connecticut, in 1905 Postcard.jpg|Postcard: Trinity College in Hartford, Connecticut]]''

